<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budimex, Elektrim, Stalexport and Universal closed lower, two stocks were flat and four did not trade in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Total turnover was at 1.4 million zlotys, down from Tuesday's 1.7 million zlotys.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 4.1 percent to 118 zlotys in a turnover of 7.1 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
